  "title": "鍵盤快速鍵",
  "seoTitle": "Codevalanche 鍵盤快速鍵",
  "description": "Codevalanche 所有預設的鍵盤快速鍵：命令面板、新增聊天、語音模式、窗格、訊息輸入框。可在設定中變更任何一項。",
  "body": "<p>在「設定 › <span class=\"ui-term\">鍵盤快速鍵</span>」中變更、新增或重設快速鍵。屬於單一位置的快速鍵，例如訊息輸入框中的，是固定的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"global\">任何地方</h2>\n<div class=\"docs-table-wrap\"><table class=\"docs-table\"><thead><tr><th>按鍵</th><th>動作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">K</kbd></td><td>開啟命令面板</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">I</kbd></td><td>將焦點移到訊息輸入框</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">N</kbd></td><td>新增聊天</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Shift</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">N</kbd></td><td>新視窗</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">O</kbd></td><td>開啟資料夾</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">,</kbd></td><td>開啟設定</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">F</kbd></td><td>搜尋聊天</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Shift</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Space</kbd></td><td>開始或停止語音模式</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"panes\">窗格與版面配置</h2>\n<div class=\"docs-table-wrap\"><table class=\"docs-table\"><thead><tr><th>按鍵</th><th>動作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">1</kbd></td><td>顯示或隱藏檔案</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">2</kbd></td><td>顯示或隱藏變更</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">3</kbd></td><td>顯示或隱藏瀏覽器</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">4</kbd></td><td>顯示或隱藏終端機窗格</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">5</kbd></td><td>顯示或隱藏側邊聊天</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">\\</kbd></td><td>關閉所有窗格</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">B</kbd></td><td>顯示或隱藏專案側邊欄</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">J</kbd></td><td>顯示或隱藏終端機</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">P</kbd></td><td>開啟檔案面板</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">T</kbd></td><td>開啟瀏覽器面板</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Alt</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">S</kbd></td><td>開啟側邊聊天</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"composer\">在訊息輸入框中</h2>\n<div class=\"docs-table-wrap\"><table class=\"docs-table\"><thead><tr><th>按鍵</th><th>動作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Enter</kbd></td><td>傳送；若正在執行中則排入佇列</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Shift</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Enter</kbd></td><td>換行</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Esc</kbd></td><td>停止執行</td></tr><tr><td><kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd class=\"docs-kbd\">U</kbd></td><td>新增相片與檔案</td></tr><tr><td><code>/</code></td><td>開啟斜線命令</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
}
